WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:18.140
Wannan bidiyon yana bayyana yadda ake shirya yaro da uwa ko mai kulawa kafin yin gwajin jajircewa a cikin jarirai da manyan yara.

2
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:29.140
Ya kamata a rike yaron amintacce duk da haka cikin kwanciyar hankali, ko dai a kan cinya, bisa kafada, ko, idan jariri, ya kwanta a bayansu.

3
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:37.120
Yana da mahimmanci a gare su su ji lafiya. Yara ƙanana na iya zama marasa natsuwa kuma suna iya buƙatar swaddled.

4
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:44.180
Yin nazarin jim kaɗan bayan ciyarwa zai iya taimakawa saboda za su kasance cikin annashuwa da ɗan barci.

5
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Manya yara za su iya daidaitawa ta yin wasa da abin wasan yara na ɗan lokaci kaɗan.

6
00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:55.320
Yi magana da sautin abokantaka kuma kuyi ƙoƙarin sauka zuwa matakin idanunsu.

7
00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.500
Bayyana abin da za ku yi kuma ku sami izini kafin ku fara.

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:10.440
Na farko, tambayi mahaifiya ko mai kula da su idan sun ga wani abu da ba daidai ba a ido ko hangen nesa da kuma tsawon lokacin da suka lura da matsalar.

9
00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:15.120
Na gaba, dubi fuskar yaron da idanunsa. Tambayi kanka wasu tambayoyi.

10
00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:24.300
Shin yaron yana da alama yana jin zafi a ido ɗaya ko duka biyu? Idanun a bude suke ko kuwa sun rufe su sosai?

11
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:31.280
Akwai shayarwa ko fitarwa daga idanu? Girman idanu iri ɗaya ne? Shin gashin ido sun kumbura?

12
00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:38.580
Yanzu, la'akari da yadda yaron yake gani. Matsar da fuskarka a hankali daga gefe zuwa gefe, kallon idanunsu.

13
00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:47.970
Yi murmushi shiru. Shin yaron yana bin motsin fuskar ku ko amsa murmushin ku na shiru?

14
00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:53.990
Kuma, tambayi kanku wasu tambayoyi. Shin idanu biyu suna motsawa cikin 'yanci kuma tare?

15
00:01:54.430 --> 00:02:01.110
Idanun sun mike ne ko ido daya yana juyawa ciki ko waje? Idanun sun yi rawar jiki?

16
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:12.200
Hakanan zaka iya amfani da hasken wuta akan Arclight da maƙasudin hoto don samun hankali da tantance ingancin hangen nesa.

17
00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:20.660
Matsar da maƙasudin gefe zuwa gefe, sama da ƙasa. Duba don ganin ko yaron yana gyarawa kuma yana bin abin da aka sa a gaba.

18
00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:26.600
Shin za su iya isa su nuna daidai a wurin da aka nufa?

19
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:35.060
Sau da yawa, ido ɗaya kawai ba ya iya gani da kyau. Kai ko uwa za ku iya rufe ido ɗaya, sannan ɗayan.

20
00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:43.320
Matsar da abin da ake nufi da kwatanta yadda yaron ya kasance lokacin amfani da idanu biyu, sannan daya bayan daya.

21
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:51.380
Idan yaron ba ya son a rufe ido ɗaya, yana nuna cewa idon da ba a rufe ba ya gani sosai.

22
00:02:51.560 --> 00:03:00.560
Idan kuna tunanin za ku iya ganin wani abu ba daidai ba tare da ido na waje, duba da kyau ta amfani da ƙarshen loupe na Arclight.

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:12.150
Kunna fitilun kuma matsa sama kusa da kusan 6 cm. Kuna iya buƙatar amfani da yatsa don buɗe idanun ido a hankali.

24
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:24.070
Tambayi kanka wasu tambayoyi. Farin bangaren ido ruwan hoda ne ko ja? Shin almajiri ko cornea launin toka ne ko fari?

25
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:35.160
Almajiri zagaye ne? Kuna iya ganin wani jikin waje? Yanzu kun shirya don yin gwaje-gwajen reflex.
